sy336Range60Sell = useSY336Best and sy336UseSellRange and sy336R60ATR < schR60Atr and sy336R60Pos > 100 - schR60Pos and stRsi3 > 100 - schRsiTh and (high - low) > schBigK * atr

sy336VolMA50 = ta.sma(volume, 50)

