sy361LiqM1ReactionBuy = not hiddenLiqNeedM1Reaction or bullReject or bullMomentum or sweepLow or realRevBuy
sy361LiqM1ReactionSell = not hiddenLiqNeedM1Reaction or bearReject or bearMomentum or sweepHigh or realRevSell
