sy361SellNearSY356Story = hiddenLiqEntryAlone ? true : (sellStory or sy334SellSweepRaw or sy334SellRangeRaw or sy334SellTrendRaw or sy336SellBest or baseSell or realRevSell or retestSell or bearFVG)

sy361LiqBoostBuy = hiddenLiqBuyRecent and hiddenLiqBuyNotLate and sy361BuyNearSY356Story and sy361LiqM1ReactionBuy and sy361LiqRoomBuy and not (powerDown and not realRevBuy and not sweepLow)
